# What the window itself says: the empty detail panel and the errors of its commands.

app-select-something = Select a device, an instance or a template on the left.
app-could-not-save = Could not save { $path }: { $error }
app-snippet-needs-save = Save the project first: the snippet names its file.
app-recent-gone = { $path } no longer exists, so it was taken off the recent projects.
app-could-not-clear = Could not clear: { $reason }
